#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:5
#: e51535af81b14dca8784209e385a23e9
msgid "C.H.U.C.K Autopilot (for Parrot Disco)"
msgstr "C.H.U.C.K 飞控（适用于 Parrot Disco）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:7
#: d0ef1992cafe46058139e4a95fe82ebd
msgid ""
"The heart of the Parrot Disco is the C.H.U.C.K autopilot, an orange box "
"which is a general purpose autopilot. It is perfectly possible to use the "
"C.H.U.C.K in a different airframe."
msgstr ""
"Parrot Disco 的核心是 C.H.U.C.K 飞控，这是一个橙色盒子，属于通用飞控。完全可以将 C.H.U.C.K 用于不同的机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:11
#: e60bd235af0949d28c92bd076110b9c6
msgid ""
"To use the C.H.U.C.K outside of a Disco the first thing you will notice is "
"it has 7 servo/motor outputs available. There are 6 PWM 3-pin servo "
"connectors, and one connector from the I2C ESC that can be used to drive a "
"brushless motor (it drives the motor on the Disco)."
msgstr ""
"若要在 Disco 以外使用 C.H.U.C.K，首先会注意到它共有 7 个舵机/电机输出。其中有 6 个 PWM 3 针舵机接头，以及一个来自 I2C"
" ESC 的接头，可用于驱动无刷电机（在 Disco 上驱动电机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:16
#: ed3d26e9b0a3437f86f2f41af04cd2e4
msgid ""
"The mapping between ArduPilot output channel numbers and the 7 outputs was "
"chosen with ease of integration with the Disco in mind, which resulted in a "
"fairly strange pin ordering."
msgstr "ArduPilot 输出通道编号与这 7 个输出之间的映射关系，是以便于与 Disco 集成为目标而设计的，因此引脚顺序较为特殊。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:20
#: 660b70b20ca54acfbeda5383e1446a85
msgid ""
"Servo rail pin numbers in the list below are from left to right when looking"
" at the C.H.U.C.K from the back, so pin1 on the servo rail is closest to the"
" first 'C' in 'C.H.U.C.K' on the case."
msgstr ""
"以下列表中的舵机轨引脚编号是从背面看 C.H.U.C.K 时从左到右排列的，因此舵机轨上的 pin1 "
"最靠近外壳上「C.H.U.C.K」字样中第一个「C」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:24
#: c6fdb098ae8a4fac8c72a8507aea28fd
msgid "channel 1 : servo rail pin 1"
msgstr "通道 1：舵机轨引脚 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:25
#: 3a95144936364cb7aad7c366655793a2
msgid "channel 2 : servo rail pin 6"
msgstr "通道 2：舵机轨引脚 6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:26
#: 4e5a59ec6fa0432b909ac9b24ea34856
msgid "channel 3 : I2C ESC motor output"
msgstr "通道 3：I2C ESC 电机输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:27
#: 009390683f0e4edc99b2172aa79e7556
msgid "channel 4 : servo rail pin 2"
msgstr "通道 4：舵机轨引脚 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:28
#: d884ff3157cd4be09d396cd1974e9861
msgid "channel 5 : servo rail pin 5"
msgstr "通道 5：舵机轨引脚 5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:29
#: 1ea82dd64b8b409992ec8eab34b54b56
msgid "channel 6 : servo rail pin 3"
msgstr "通道 6：舵机轨引脚 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:30
#: 9db5cf0e5894488785d74de8b78d9411
msgid "channel 7 : servo rail pin 4"
msgstr "通道 7：舵机轨引脚 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:32
#: b5b61abe164342e4b390f4ee7b0163d5
msgid ""
"Note that this pin ordering means you will need some extra parameter "
"settings if you are not using the I2C ESC motor controller for throttle "
"output. To take the simple example of a 4 channel fixed wing plane (aileron,"
" elevator, throttle, rudder) you could configure and wire it like this:"
msgstr ""
"请注意，这种引脚排列意味着如果不使用 I2C ESC 电机控制器作为油门输出，则需要额外的参数设置。以一架简单的 4 "
"通道固定翼飞机（副翼、升降舵、油门、方向舵）为例，可按如下方式配置和连接："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:38
#: e377b7cf4498472d8d0c97d0d29a5328
msgid "servo rail pin1 : ailerons (on Y-lead if need be for 2 servos)"
msgstr "舵机轨引脚 1：副翼（如需接两个舵机可使用 Y 形线）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:39
#: d9bd573b5e964275bd61726d820b3c2f
msgid "servo rail pin6 : elevator"
msgstr "舵机轨引脚 6：升降舵"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:40
#: 0bfaa189c1c64bdfb3e5e3712531e45a
msgid "servo rail pin5 : throttle"
msgstr "舵机轨引脚 5：油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:41
#: 51187bcc39394cdeae14921e6c173833
msgid "servo rail pin2 : rudder"
msgstr "舵机轨引脚 2：方向舵"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:42
#: 434fc074eb024bb786a753f094913b56
msgid ""
"set SERVO5_FUNCTION=70 or RC5_FUNCTION=70 to make channel 5 output throttle"
msgstr "设置 SERVO5_FUNCTION=70 或 RC5_FUNCTION=70，使通道 5 输出油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:43
#: abc47f3d92a04cde9ca5da9b4ea091aa
msgid ""
"set SERVO5_MIN/RC5_MIN, SERVO5_MAX/RC5_MAX and SERVO5_TRIM/RC5_TRIM for the "
"throttle range of your motor"
msgstr ""
"设置 SERVO5_MIN/RC5_MIN、SERVO5_MAX/RC5_MAX 及 SERVO5_TRIM/RC5_TRIM，以匹配电机的油门范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:45
#: b45a0a6bf5cb4146aa8c45d1fa8c460d
msgid ""
"Apart from that pin mapping, setting up a C.H.U.C.K with another airframe is"
" the same as with any aircraft with ArduPilot. It could be used with any "
"vehicle type supported by ArduPilot, including gliders, quadplanes, petrol "
"planes, multicopters or rovers."
msgstr ""
"除引脚映射不同外，将 C.H.U.C.K 用于其他机架与在任何搭载 ArduPilot 的飞机上使用完全相同。它可用于 ArduPilot "
"支持的任何飞行器类型，包括滑翔机、四旋翼垂直起降飞机、汽油动力飞机、多旋翼或地面车辆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:50
#: 43ae86fda58f4a4c9d4c634e40698211
msgid ""
"For R/C input there is a 3-pin servo lead connector on the left side of the "
"C.H.U.C.K which accepts the following widely used R/C protocols:"
msgstr "RC 输入方面，C.H.U.C.K 左侧有一个 3 针舵机线接头，支持以下常见 RC 协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:54
#: d1c07f4a301049e68e1692329320340b
msgid "SBUS"
msgstr "SBUS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:55
#: 75dadc9fcf854c15853c5b7bb4a15aa8
msgid "DSM/Skektrum"
msgstr "DSM/Spektrum"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:56
#: 0e175404174d4113bb0b79a55a464614
msgid "SUMD (Graupner)"
msgstr "SUMD（Graupner）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:57
#: dc8522d60cf5472e8b1160055ce06269
msgid "ST24 (Yuneec)"
msgstr "ST24（Yuneec）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CHUCK-overview.rst:59
#: c60e0d00f1d64fbfb6ecb7192d4cbc1c
msgid ""
"The use of the airspeed sensor and sonar will be dependent on the physical "
"shape of the airframe and whether the positioning of these sensors is "
"suitable for the layout of the C.H.U.C.K."
msgstr "空速传感器和声呐的使用将取决于机架的物理形状，以及这些传感器的安装位置是否适合 C.H.U.C.K 的布局。"
